lity and efficiency by leveraging layer-level signals[3][6].\n\nIf you are looking for the image segmentation tool, you can find the repository under **`VjiaoBlack/layercake`** on GitHub, where it is described as a utility for converting photos into depth-ordered transparent layers using SAM 2[1][2].\n\nSources:\n[1] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGd4IYpwmxlUvHRdEivpMiz06-Qswwgd7dqYGNEuv3WBdxMlHOKKKkwtE71EhrbIRCXGpN1Va92jFk5Gq7Ts4WsDfxFgr3kJVLzYPooeyW__anoy-Zs52YuTgZEjW0=)\n[2] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGd4IYpwmxlUvHRdEivpMiz06-Qswwgd7dqYGNEuv3WBdxMlHOKKKkwtE71EhrbIRCXGpN1Va92jFk5Gq7Ts4WsDfxFgr3kJVLzYPooeyW__anoy-Zs52YuTgZEjW0=)\n[3] [mpg.de](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEyutape7tDNVRjj3VsBMFSkSJasAy9sgz8BVO9S3raoncRYwD5dI06XAAOo1sp-H5KdHmmbw7kzNtAJHGTW0_Bf1thQobyvm-hVtBNtazJ9JjHiLfcWKT7yTVdF2c5YI8JeMCbIM9zl21QIAZDwVQn8FKyGbidbrn1GCKyqvNWsMmY3B7U52SxqMKk8Vpz7GAJi9U=)\n[4] [sebastianraschka.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHmp15LWtsIXjU3ib6b9I18I82Cb2rz4WibS0rmi3ETtW1yxV1G27OOOmotdMVO5lScH8vM83vXgPmbn_cYzxomBADTpjbUVPDyDtaarIDiigmKxOJMUU5b-wo3pjhH7ePdZqZKlh3mHYs_4IP1uAN3UfufVP8HcDYWxM_H)\n[5] [fugumt.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHW3fvk_F2db2AKFKWhNa7vjJBB_ShKPjTLcU3HWTek519J-Emw_KXo61LC5nQVpTUF-XAf3mw_vgiIyOWIaT-KtVp4npE2NYPTvIpOZUYa7cdEHZtwpP0kwmJkHmP571iotdo0UOQ_mcKRpg_6_XQ=)\n[6] [mpg.de](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEBMcfbLxI-Q2-DvtyS2CSUx1srluPxttEFdhqPFSfLP1XE-tkdqBVstnE78lzypsk4IP6pi1Y15H5VIzF-XN-4nF3OgaEr78whM2ZZTqXen7Xffo_OnJHXRk6MNODJInqh5dABA1jXGnonNtSEiV6S4qPxA2ou778EOKZtE6f73PV2d9INMY3JnrQWoKiovKE1qqrUe3dqhqUEhSQPQOkRiBf_52l4LvQj7fW70s43)"}
